2026/Jun/29 06:38:36.506532 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:226 *** Purpose: Verify MS reports time difference (motdif) after non-sync HO ***
2026/Jun/29 06:38:36.506541 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:227 *** TWO_CELL: ARFCN 51 (Cell A main BTS) + ARFCN 56 (Cell B n56 BTS) ***
2026/Jun/29 06:38:36.506549 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:228 *** FH-SKIP: C_Test_fh preamble and TCH hopping approximated as h=0 fixed ***
